{"version":1,"content":"<p>凌晨1時12分，警方接獲途人報案指，將軍澳寶寧路25號公共單車泊位的數輛單車起火。</p><p>消防員接報到場將火救熄，經消防初步調查後，發現共有9輛單車被燒毀，起火原因有可疑，交由警方處理。</p><p>案件列作「縱火」，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>事件中無人受傷，亦毋須疏散。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:21:27.131858+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T03:50:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T02:18:07.082638+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T04:17:57.790803+00:00","content_hash":"b5a8feb446f335ee215bba45110f1d1dc2aec67f08532f14c982fc610ba77594","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}